  "id": "cherry-tomato-meatball-ragu-with-crispy-baby-potato-crust",
  "name": "Cherry Tomato Meatball Ragu with Crispy Baby Potato Crust",
  "subtitle": "A baked meatball ragu topped with golden baby potatoes and grated cheese.",
  "description": "Build a tomato-rich meatball ragu, cover it with partially cooked baby potatoes, and bake until the crust is crisp and the meatballs reach a safe temperature.",
  "meal_type": "dessert",
  "yield": {
